    <p><strong>Technology:</strong> Proficient in Musescore, Finale, Soundtrap, Garageband, FL Studio, SmartMusic, Flat.io, and Canva.</p>
    <p><strong>Certifications & Clearances:</strong> CPR/AED/First Aid Certified (Exp. 2028). PA Clearances: Act 34, 151, 114.</p>
    <p><strong>Affiliations:</strong> NAfME, PMEA, JEN.</p>
